  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Kym Rapier is an American philanthropist and founder of the Kym Rapier Foundation, supporting community organisations internationally. Her business background includes founding Silver Life Fitness, part of WellMed, and running a candle company. She and healthcare entrepreneur George Rapier established family charities supporting education, older people, children and animal welfare.",
